{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33058","headline":"山中效陶 · 曹邺","name":"山中效陶","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"落第非有罪，兹山聊归止。\n山猨隔云住，共饮山中水。\n读书时有兴，坐石忘却起。\n西山忽然暮，往往遗巾履。\n经时一出门，兼候僮仆喜。\n常被山翁笑，求名岂如此。\n齿髪老未衰，何如且求己。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"曹邺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33058.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33058","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}